f=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\"><img alt=\"Tower Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tower_Shield_ea3208.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Darashia Dragons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"92\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darashia_Dragons_7a1e63.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.50<br/>July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p>The <b>Darashia Dragon Lair</b> is a cave to the north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>. Only players of level 40 or higher are allowed to pass the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gate%20of%20Expertise\">Gate of Expertise</a> which marks the entrance.\n</p><p>The Lair contains many <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragons\">Dragons</a> of all kind, including <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Hatchlings</a> and Dragon Lords. On the bottom level you could even find <a href=\"#/wiki/Demodras\">Demodras</a>.\n</p><p>This is a great spot to hunt Dragons, as the respawn is great. Even with many players online, there is a dragon for everyone. It's also a great place for <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>, as there is much space for you to run them.\n</p><p>However, if you're unexperienced, you should enter the lair with caution. If the spawns are completely full and you're unfamiliar with hunting Dragons, their numbers can surprise you.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>First hunting level</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\"><img alt=\"Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_24987b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">430 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">120 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">310 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-lo